<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-SWEDEN TO AUCTION 12 BLN SKR T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SWEDEN TO AUCTION 12 BLN SKR T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would auction seven billion crowns ($872.4 million) worth of five-month treasury bills and five billion crowns worth of six-month bills.</p>
<p>Bids are due at 1030 GMT on the day of the auction.  </p>
<p>						149-day bill    176-day bill</p>
<p> Maturity date			    Jan 21, 1998    Feb 18, 1998</p>
<p> Volume to market (Billions Skr)    7.0		 5.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			  Aug 22	    Aug 22</p>
<p> Auction date			     Aug 20	    Aug 20</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
